{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","腾跃落箭"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","一雫の矢"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入警戒状态，会在敌人释放终极技能时将其打断。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","警戒状態になり、敵が必殺技を発動する時に、必殺技の発動を中断させる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时进入“警戒”状态。当非召唤物敌军释放终极技能时，五月立即进入霸体状态，飞跃至其头顶向其发射一支禁魔箭，造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并打断其终极技能，使其失去700点能量，随后结束“警戒”和霸体状态。本技能无法打断首领敌人但造成的伤害提高400%。\n使用终极技能时，选择一名非召唤物敌军或者自身，进入“警戒状态”。选择自身释放时，将对所有非召唤物敌军进行“警戒”。选择一名非召唤物敌军释放时，将只对其进行“警戒”，但五月会在其处于不可选中状态超过3秒或被击败后，转而对所有敌人“警戒”。\n自动战斗时，只会选择自身释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：戦闘開始時、「警戒」状態になる。召喚ユニット以外の敵が必殺技を発動する時、スーパーアーマー状態になり、その敵の頭上にジャンプし、魔封じの矢を放ち、200% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、必殺技の発動を中断させ、対象のSPを700減少させる。攻撃後、「警戒」とスーパーアーマー状態を解除。このスキルはボスの必殺技発動を中断できない。その代わり、必殺技のダメージ+400%\nアクティブ効果：召喚ユニット以外の敵1体または自身を選択し、「警戒」状態になる。自身を選択した場合は召喚ユニット以外の敵全体を「警戒」、召喚ユニット以外の敵1体を選択した場合はその敵のみを「警戒」する。選択した敵が選択不可状態になり、3秒以上経過した場合、または選択した敵が撃破された場合、敵全体を「警戒」するようになる\nオート戦闘の場合は必ず自身を選択して発動する"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":66,"end":72,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":84,"end":90,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":62,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":107,"end":109,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":80,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":139,"end":147,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","魔封じの矢のダメージが210% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","魔封じの矢のダメージが220% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","魔封じの矢のダメージが230% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","禁魔箭造成伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","魔封じの矢のダメージが240% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","疾雨之舞"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","疾雨の舞"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成多次伤害，期间处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵に複数回ダメージを与え、攻撃期間中、自身は無敵状態になる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","闪现至目标身旁，以神出鬼没的身姿对目标进行6次攻击，每次造成65% + 8% ATK伤害，期间处于无敌状态，随后返回自己此前的位置。若在释放本技能期间响应了“警戒”状态，则五月会在响应结束后继续完成剩余的攻击。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","対象の近くまで瞬間移動し、対象を6回攻撃し、1回の攻撃につき、65% + 8% ATKのダメージを与える。攻撃期間中、自身は無敵状態になる。攻撃後、瞬間移動する前の位置まで戻る。このスキルの発動中に「警戒」状態の効果が発動した場合、「警戒」発動終了後に、このスキルによる攻撃を続ける"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":62,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至70% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが70% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至75% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが75% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが80% + 8% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","羽翼渐丰"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","飛び立つ翼"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","在战斗中持续成长，每次成长会提升自身攻击力，并使后续箭矢额外造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘中に成長し続け、成長するたびに自身の攻撃力がUPし、矢の攻撃にダメージを追加"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","五月可以在战斗中不断学习和积累经验。每当五月普通攻击或释放技能时，均会获得经验值，参与击败敌方英雄获得额外大量经验值。当经验值积累满后，五月便可获得一次成长，永久提高10%攻击力，并使自己接下来的4发普通攻击或者“疾雨之舞”的箭矢获得强化，额外附带目标3% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身75% + 15%攻击力。成长带来的属性提升效果最多可以叠加4次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","メイは戦闘中に経験を積み、成長する。メイが通常攻撃を行う時、またはスキルを発動する時、経験値を獲得。敵英雄の撃破に関与した場合、追加で大量の経験値を獲得。経験値が上限まで貯まるたびに、メイは成長し、永続的に攻撃力+10%、通常攻撃または「疾雨の舞」の矢の攻撃を合計4回分強化し、攻撃時に追加で対象のHP上限×3% + 0.6%の確定ダメージを与える。この確定ダメージは自身の攻撃力×75% + 15%を超えない。成長によるステータス上昇効果は4回まで重複可能"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":128,"end":135,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":156,"end":162,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":156,"end":163,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":194,"end":200,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":54,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","强化箭矢额外附带目标4% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身100% + 15%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","強化された矢に対象のHP上限×4% + 0.6%の確定ダメージを追加。この確定ダメージは自身の攻撃力×100% + 15%を超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","强化箭矢额外附带目标5% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身125% + 15%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","強化された矢に対象のHP上限×5% + 0.6%の確定ダメージを追加。この確定ダメージは自身の攻撃力×125% + 15%を超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","强化箭矢额外附带目标6% + 0.6%最大生命值的真实伤害，最高不超过自身150% + 15%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","強化された矢に対象のHP上限×6% + 0.6%の確定ダメージを追加。この確定ダメージは自身の攻撃力×150% + 15%を超えない"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":55,"end":61,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身穿透。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の防御貫通UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的穿透提升10点，且在“疾雨之舞”期间额外提升5点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の防御貫通+10。「疾雨の舞」の発動中、追加で自身の防御貫通+5"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的穿透提升13点，且在“疾雨之舞”期间额外提升6点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の防御貫通+13。「疾雨の舞」の発動中、追加で自身の防御貫通+6"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的穿透提升16点，且在“疾雨之舞”期间额外提升8点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の防御貫通+16。「疾雨の舞」の発動中、追加で自身の防御貫通+8"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","啜饮甘霖"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","雨の恵み"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得友军增益效果时，立刻获得一次成长。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","味方によるバフを獲得した時、1回成長する"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，立即获得一次成长，一场战斗每名友军最多只能触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","味方から非永続的なステータス上昇効果を受けた時、直ちに1回成長する。味方1体につき、1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次成长带来的攻击力提升效果提升至12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","1回の成長につき、攻撃力上昇効果が12%にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次成长时，使得自身下一次“疾雨之舞”附带额外2段攻击。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","成長するたびに、自身の次の「疾雨の舞」に2回分の攻撃を追加"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次成长带来的攻击力提升效果提升至14%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","1回の成長につき、攻撃力上昇効果が14%にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能首次打断敌人使其失去的能量提升。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「一雫の矢」で初めて敵の必殺技発動を中断させた時、対象のSP減少量UP"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“腾跃落箭”首次打断敌人终极技能时，使敌人失去的能量提升至1000点。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「一雫の矢」で初めて敵の必殺技発動を中断させた時、対象のSP減少量が1000にUP"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","鸣鸢"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","バードソング"]]}